    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42349" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρευνάω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				670.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρευτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρευνητής</span>
			, <i>exactor, collector of stale-debts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				527.132
			</span></i> (Dreros, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5073.18
			</span></i> (Cnossus, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέω</span> (A).)</div>
